      "quote": "後主諱叔寶，字元秀，小字黃奴，高宗嫡長子也。",
      "note": "陳叔寶父。",
      "chapter_id": "c-chenshu-006-wangmeng-houzhu-context",
      "book_id": "b-chenshu-006",
